{"id":"d7f5f48649dc1820","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-ci-eventually-different-real.md","title":"ZFC CI Eventually Different Real","display":"df-zfc-ci-eventually-different-real — ZFC CI Eventually Different Real","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ci-eventually-different-real","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ci-eventually-different-real"],"display":"df-zfc-ci-eventually-different-real — ZFC CI Eventually Different Real","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-omega]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ci-eventually-different-real"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ci-eventually-different-real</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ci-eventually-different-real — ZFC CI Eventually Different Real"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"58-df-omega\">58-df-omega</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g\\in V\">\\(f,g\\in V\\)</span> (reals as function graphs on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in\\omega\">\\(m,n\\in\\omega\\)</span> (eventual-bound indices)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCiEventuallyDifferentReal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCiEventuallyDifferentReal}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function-graph predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}eventually\\text{-}different\\text{-}real} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCiEventuallyDifferentReal}_S(f,g)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\omega)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,\\omega,\\omega)\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;(n\\subseteq m\\to f(m)\\neq g(m))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}eventually\\text{-}different\\text{-}real} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCiEventuallyDifferentReal}_S(f,g)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\omega)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,\\omega,\\omega)\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;(n\\subseteq m\\to f(m)\\neq g(m))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Natural-number order is written as ordinal inclusion, and both reals are typed function graphs.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-omega]]","embed":false}],